      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a4e25abae715b48f1d1f30a|full_name}: Agreed. It would be less work for the devs to allow the room owner to approve requests, which should also be implemented in invite only. Allow the room owner to approve or deny all invites rather than some odd message about \"ask (owner) to invite them\" when they aren't already a friend of the owner.",
