  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would be very useful to have friends only+ instance type.\nMain point is ability for friends to join instance owner without invite but people who not friends with instance owner and friends of instance guests should be able to request invite from their friends who already in friend only+ instance.\n\nThis will solve issue with friends only instances when friends of friends can't join instance but will be safer than friends+ instance type.",
